{"id":"u-e5bf5813-8fab-44f4-bbb0-73a0e5a77f20","src":"community","title":"Deadlift Progression [2 Days]","author":"Jester","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/PLrEyn-deadlift-specialist-2-days","desc":"This program is a very intense deadlift program. Make sure you have your deadlift form dialed before starting this program! Also, before starting make sure your 1RM is correct. Don't try to (over)estimate it or do an awful 1RM test where you grind out an awful rep with a rounded back and lifting the weight out of your back! Do a proper 1RM test, with a clean rep! Otherwise the calculated % will be off and the load will be too high!\nThis program works with any kind of deadlift (conventional, sumo, hexbar, etc.), just pick the one that feels comfortable for your body composition. If you're taller and pull conventional, consider putting some small 5-10kg plates below your weights to lift up the bar a bit. This ensures a good starting position and lowers the chance of lifting up your butt (->back pain) during the start of the lift.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-09-26T12:07:14.226Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Halting Deadlift","sets":[{"r":1,"rpe":85},{"r":1,"rpe":87.5}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":77.5,"x":2},{"r":5,"pct":82.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":5},{"r":8,"rpe":7},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":3,"pct":82.5},{"r":3,"pct":87.5},{"r":3,"pct":77.5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Deadlift Eccentric 3sec (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"rpe":70,"x":3}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Halting Deadlift","sets":[{"r":1,"rpe":85,"x":2},{"r":1,"rpe":92.5}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":77.5},{"r":5,"pct":82.5,"x":2},{"r":5,"pct":72.5}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":5},{"r":8,"rpe":7},{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"